. &c.:\nĀ. (Subj. 3. sg. -शि॑षातै, AV. ii, 31, 13) to be left remaining:\nPass. -शिष्यते (aor. उ॑च्-छेषि, AV. xi, 9, 13) to be left remaining, TāṇḍyaBr.; ŚBr.; AitBr. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "ucCiswa": [{"id": "ucCizwa", "headword": "उच्छिष्ट", "headword_slp1": "ucCizwa", "fold": "ucCiswa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "उ॑च्-छिष्ट mfn. left, rejected, stale", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "spit out of the mouth (as remnants of food), TS.; ChUp.; ŚBr.; MBh.; Yājñ. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "one who has still the remains of food in the mouth or hands, one who has not washed his hands and mouth and therefore is considered impure, impure, Gaut.; Mn.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "उ॑च्-छिष्ट n. that which is spit out", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "leavings, fragments, remainder (especially of a sacrifice or of food), AV.; ŚBr.; KātyŚr.; Mn.; ĀśvGṛ. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["उच्छिष्टं"], "synonyms_slp1": ["ucCizwaM"]}], "ucCiswakalpana": [{"id": "ucCizwakalpanA", "headword": "उच्छिष्टकल्पना", "headword_slp1": "ucCizwakalpanA", "fold": "ucCiswakalpana", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "उच्-छिष्ट—कल्पना f. a stale invention.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "ucCiswagaRapati": [{"id": "ucCizwagaRapati", "headword": "उच्छिष्टगणपति", "headword_slp1": "ucCizwagaRapati", "fold": "ucCiswagaRapati", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "उच्-छिष्ट—गणपति or उच्-छिष्ट—गणेश, m. (opposed to शुद्ध-गणपति), Gaṇeśa as worshipped by the Ucchiṣṭas (or men who leave the remains of food in their mouth during prayer), Tantras. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["उच्छिष्टगणपतिः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["ucCizwagaRapatiH"]}], "ucCiswagaResa": [{"id": "ucCizwagaReSa", "headword": "उच्छिष्टगणेश", "headword_slp1": "ucCizwagaReSa", "fold": "ucCiswagaResa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{